# Play test of Twin Forges (CIPlay twin_forges, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The saddle at 30 m along the line from -12.4 -17.4 to 17.4 0.4, the bridge over the chasm at 2.5 -8.5 (ladders down from
# its middle); the chasm (floor 22 m) from 10.7 -22.2 to -5.7 5.2; the vault's door at -1.4 -2.1; the Anvil round 14.2 -1.5
# and the Bellows round -9.2 -15.6 (at the saddle's ends); the adit's mouth at 29 40 (floor 4 m); the clamps round -11 -50.
island Twin Forges
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Master-Smith
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
at 2.5 -8.5 h=31.5
zone saddle
expect step 1
read The contest's rules
expect step 2
walk 2.5 -8.5 to 12 -3 h=30.05
at 13.5 -2.2 h=30.6
zone anvil
expect step 3
read Brann's chalkboard
expect step 4
use anvilforge
expect message furnace, cold
at 29 43 h=5
walk 29 43 to 29 37 h=4
use ore1
use ore2
use ore3
expect story ore 3
expect step 5
use anvilforge
expect story northblade 1
expect step 6
zone clamps
expect message boars
kill Warthog
expect step 7
use coal1
use coal2
use coal3
expect story charcoal 3
expect step 8
at -5 -13.5 h=31
walk -5 -13.5 to -9.2 -15.6 h=30.05
zone bellows
use bellowsforge
expect story southblade 1
expect step 9
at 2.5 -8.5 h=31.5
use judgingstone
expect shown verdict
read The verdict
expect step 10
wait 7
expect shown warden
kill Mama bear
expect step 11
at 2.5 -8.5 h=23
walk 2.5 -8.5 to -1.4 -2.1 to -3.7 1.8 h=22.05
zone vault
expect step 12
open The contest prize
expect done
open Anvil bench box
open Bellows barrel
open Jetty box
open Sunk ingot crate
